---
layout: base.njk
title: Request a Quote
description: Get a custom quote for Disco Carrot at your ski resort or venue. Book a call with our team.
permalink: /request-quote/
---
<style>
  .quote-hero {
    padding: 160px 48px 40px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .quote-hero .eyebrow {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--orange); margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .quote-hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .quote-hero p {
    font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--muted); max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .cal-inline-wrapper {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 48px 100px;
    min-height: 600px;
  }
  .cal-inline-wrapper iframe {
    border: none;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 600px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .quote-hero { padding: 120px 24px 40px; }
    .cal-inline-wrapper { padding: 20px 24px 80px; }
  }
</style>

<div class="quote-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">For Resorts & Venues</p>
  <h1>Request a Quote</h1>
  <p>Tell us about your resort, your event, and your timeline. We'll build a custom package that fits your mountain and your budget.</p>
</div>

<div class="cal-inline-wrapper">
  <div id="cal-inline" style="width:100%;height:100%;overflow:auto;"></div>
</div>

<script type="text/javascript">
Cal("init", "resort-inline", { origin: "https://cal.com" });
Cal.ns["resort-inline"]("inline", {
  elementOrSelector: "#cal-inline",
  calLink: "disco-carrot/resort-and-venue",
  layout: "month_view",
  config: { theme: "dark" }
});
Cal.ns["resort-inline"]("ui", {
  theme: "dark",
  styles: { branding: { brandColor: "#FF5C00" } },
  hideEventTypeDetails: false,
  layout: "month_view"
});
</script>
